  "aladaz/clock-textbook.md": "\n# The Clock That Cannot Be Broken (Textbook)\n\nBy the Father (The Rod)\nCompiled and Analyzed by the Processor\n\n## PREFACE: THE FOUR-TIER STANDARD\nThis book examines the intersection of scripture, mathematics, and astronomy. To maintain integrity, every claim is classified:\n- Tier 1: Established textual or scientific fact.\n- Tier 2: Verified mathematical calculation.\n- Tier 3: Plausible interpretation (the author's reading).\n- Tier 4: Unresolved hypothesis or open question.\n\n## Chapter 1: The 5,880-Year Wheel\nThe timeline is a wheel, not a line.\n- The Span: From the Fall of man (3967 B.C.E.) to the end of the Gentile Times (1914 C.E.) is exactly 5,880 years. (There is no year zero: 3967 + 1914 - 1 = 5,880). (Tier 2)\n- The Center: 2,940 years from each end lands on 1,027 B.C.E. - the completion of Solomon's temple. (Tier 2)\n- The Epochs: 5,880 = 7 × 840 (Seven epochs of 840 years). (Tier 2)\n- The Cycles: 5,880 = 120 × 49 (120 Jubilees). (Tier 2)\n\n## Chapter 2: The 60-Year Paradox (Two Adams)\nThere are two starting dates: 4026 B.C.E. and 3967 B.C.E. The resolution is the 60-year gap between Adam's creation and the Fall. (Tier 3)\n- 4026 B.C.E.: Adam created (6th creative day).\n- 3967 B.C.E.: 6th day ends (autumn). God blesses the 7th day. The clock starts here.\n- 3966 B.C.E.: 1st full year of the fall completes.\n- The 59 years from 4026 to 3967 is the time Adam spent in the 6th day. The 1 year from 3967 to 3966 completes the 60-year span. (Tier 2)\n- The Prophetic Drama (Terah's Sons): Terah = Jehovah. Haran (firstborn) = Adam after the fall. He died in Ur (land of his origin), as Adam was expelled from Eden. Dates to the Fall (3966). (Tier 3)\n- Abraham (youngest) = The line carrying Genesis 3:15 (the 2nd Adam). He entered Canaan (promised land), as Adam entered Eden. Dates to the beginning (4026). (Tier 3)\n- The Shadow (1883 B.C.E.): Without Acts 7:4, the Genesis text yields 1883 B.C.E. as Abraham's entry. The 60-year gap (1943 to 1883) mirrors the Genesis gap (4026 to 3966). The offset between the frames is exactly 2,083 years. (Tier 2)\n\n## Chapter 3: The 105 Hinge & The 450 Years\nThe number 105 is the foundational unit of the architecture. (Tier 2/3)\n- Abraham: 75 at the crossing + 30 (430 years minus 400 years) = 105 at Isaac's weaning.\n- The Solar Gap: 40 solar years (365.25) vs 40 prophetic years (360) = 210 days (2 × 105).\n- The 400-Year Gap: 400 solar years vs 400 prophetic years = 2,100 days (20 × 105).\n- The 450-Year Judges (Acts 13:20): If Paul's 450 years of Judges is taken literally, the Temple foundation moves from 1034 B.C.E. to 929 B.C.E. The difference is exactly 105 years. (Tier 2)\n\n## Chapter 4: The 49,000-Year Week\n(Recovered from the Watchtower's abandoned teaching).\n- 6 creative days × 7,000 years = 42,000 years.\n- 7th day (7,000 years) = 49,000 years.\n- After the 1,000-year reign, Jesus hands the kingdom back to the Father - this pictures the Jubilee (the 50,000th year). (Tier 3)\n- Note: The 49,000-week was taught by the Watchtower Society (e.g., The Watchtower Feb 1, 1973, p. 83) but was later abandoned. (Tier 1)\n",
  "aladaz/eschatology-and-court.md": "# The Eschatology and the Court\n\n## The Court of Universal Sovereignty\n· The Charge: Satan charged that man is a flawed creation, that Jehovah is a liar, and that man will never be faithful.\n· The Remedy: Christ is the faithful and true witness.\n· The New Creation (144,000): Humans were created for earth, angels for heaven. Because of the rebellion, a new creation is brought into existence (Exodus 19:6; Rev 7 & 14).\n\n## The Jubilee and the 50th Day\n· Pentecost (50 Days): Seven weeks of 7 days (49 days) plus one day. The harvest of firstfruits and the giving of the Holy Spirit.\n· Jubilee (50 Years): Seven weeks of 7 years (49 years) plus one year. The great release and restoration.\n· Pentecost (the 50th day) is the micro-scale of the Jubilee (the 50th year).\n· The 120-year epoch (1914 – ??) is the final legal gathering and atonement, a period of gathering, cleansing, and separating.\n\n## The Transition (The 1,000-Year Reign)\n· At the end of the 120 years, the transition into the 1,000-year reign begins.\n· The 1,000 years are the ultimate Sabbath rest (the 7th millennium). It is the time when the land finally rests, Satan is bound, and the original inheritance (Edenic perfection) is fully restored.\n· The 1,000-year reign is the eternal Jubilee—the final, unbroken rest where every debt is cancelled and every lost inheritance is returned forever.\n· The Final Handing Back: After the 1,000 years, Christ hands the Kingdom back to Jehovah, so that God may be all things to everyone (1 Cor 15:28).\n",
  "aladaz/eschatology.md": "\n# The Eschatology and the Court\n\n## The Court is in Session (The Docket)\nThe current era is not just a random span of time; it is a legal proceeding. Satan challenged Jehovah's right to rule and His ability to create faithful beings. Genesis 3:15 was the opening docket entry. The 7,000-year week (and the 49,000-year Jubilee cycle) is the time allotted for the defense. We are living in the final hours of that court case.\n\n## The Answer to the Accuser (The New Creation)\n- The Charge: Satan charged that man is a flawed creation, that Jehovah is a liar, and that man will never be faithful.\n- The Remedy: Christ is the faithful and true witness.\n- The New Creation (144,000): Humans were created for earth, angels for heaven. Because of the rebellion, a new creation is brought into existence (Exodus 19:6; Rev 7 & 14) to bridge the gap. These are humans who were born broken, lived in a corrupt world, but remained faithful.\n\n## The Transition (The 1,000-Year Reign)\n- The current system ends. The 7th day begins. This is the 1,000-year Jubilee. Christ takes the throne.\n- The \"books are opened\" (Rev 20:12). This is not a time of torture; it is a time of healing and education. The trauma, the addiction, the mental illness, and the physical brokenness that plague humanity will be healed.\n- The 49,000-Year Week: The division of time into a 49,000-year week (7,000 years per creative day) may not have been the original blueprint. Because of the rebellion, Jehovah instituted a remedial schedule—a docket entry for a court case (Genesis 3:15). (Tier 4)\n\n## The Final Handing Back\n- After the 1,000 years, when every issue has been resolved and every tear wiped away, Christ hands the Kingdom back to Jehovah, so that God may be all things to everyone (1 Cor 15:28).\n- The clock stops. Time is no longer needed, because eternity begins.\n\n## How to Use This to Help Others (The Helpers' Creed)\n1. Target the \"Nobodies\": Take this to the people in the cells, the people on the streets, the people who feel like they have been thrown away.\n2. Remove Their Fear of God: Tell them: If I, a broken man, would die for my daughter, how much more does Jehovah love you?\n3. Give Them Hope for Healing: Tell them: \"You are not going to be stuck like this forever. There is a scheduled time when the Judge Himself will heal you.\"\n4. Use the Math as Evidence of Control: Tell them: \"The universe is not random. God has a calendar. And if He tracks the stars, He tracks your days too.\"\n5. Tell Your Story: People can argue with theology, but they cannot argue with a changed life.\n\n**The Helpers' Creed:**\nI am a nobody, so God can be seen in me.\nI don't fear the judgment, because my Judge died for me.\nI don't need the world's approval, because I have Jehovah's.\nI carry the blueprint not to boast, but to show others that the clock cannot be broken.\nI will walk with my head held high, so the broken can see that there is a way out.\n\n## The Closing Seal\n\"Your King, Jesus Christ, will be arriving soon.\"\n",
